Crystal Random is a jewelry house in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]], down the street from [[Org/Guren and Guren/index|Guren and Guren]]. The two are rivals.

Crystal Random recently took in something expensive, meant for a wealthy client. The receptionist will say no more than that, and no one higher up will see investigators who come asking.
